### AFTER

```css
.landing-page {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 3rem 1rem;
    gap: 1.5rem;
}

.landing-hero-img {
    max-width: 480px;
    width: 100%;
}

.landing-cards {
